{
  "date": "2026-10-31",
  "compiled": "03:39 AKDT",
  "window": "Oct. 30–31, 2026",
  "summary": "Alaska State Troopers arrested a Fairbanks man on harassment and disorderly conduct charges on Friday evening after a report of a man going in and out of traffic on University Avenue, and investigated the death of an 88-year-old Fairbanks resident the same evening, which troopers attribute to underlying health issues. No new criminal case was filed at any of the four Interior courthouses between Friday afternoon and Saturday morning. The Alaska Court System's weekly filings report, covering Oct. 24 to Oct. 30, lists 36 Fairbanks cases, five at Nenana, one at Delta Junction and none at Healy; five Fairbanks case numbers that exist on the court's own database for that period do not appear in it. The court system's weekly dispositions report has not been updated since Oct. 26, so case outcomes since that date are not available from it.",
  "commentary": null,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "akpik-harassment-1030",
      "date": "2026-10-30",
      "time": "17:00",
      "place": "Fairbanks",
      "agency": "Alaska State Troopers",
      "category": "other",
      "severity": "other",
      "cases": [
        "AK26107593"
      ],
      "title": "Harassment and disorderly conduct arrest: Ellis Akpik",
      "body": [
        "Ellis Akpik was arrested on charges of harassment in the first degree, harassment in the second degree and disorderly conduct. Troopers say they were called to University Avenue near Sophie Station in Fairbanks at about 5 p.m. on Oct. 30 for a man running in and out of the road while intoxicated, that he spat on troopers and lunged at them, and that he kicked his dog, which was taken to Animal Control. He was remanded to the Fairbanks Correctional Center.",
        "University Avenue near Sophie Station, Fairbanks, Oct. 30 at about 5 p.m.; Alaska State Troopers. Trooper case AK26107593."
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "AST daily dispatch, Oct. 30",
          "url": "https://dailydispatch.dps.alaska.gov/Home/Display?dateReceived=10/30/2026+12:00:00+AM"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fairbanks-death-1030",
      "date": "2026-10-30",
      "time": "18:46",
      "place": "Fairbanks",
      "agency": "Alaska State Troopers",
      "category": "other",
      "severity": "other",
      "cases": [
        "AK26107635"
      ],
      "title": "Death investigation in Fairbanks",
      "body": [
        "Alaska State Troopers say they received a report of a deceased person in Fairbanks at about 6:46 p.m. on Oct. 30, and that the investigation found the decedent, an 88-year-old Fairbanks resident, died of underlying health issues. Troopers say the next of kin has been notified and that no suspicious activity surrounds the investigation. No name has been released.",
        "Fairbanks, Oct. 30 at about 6:46 p.m.; Alaska State Troopers. Trooper case AK26107635."
      ],
